                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg534">p. 534</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d525-f2" n="1" xml:id="d525-f2-content">
                <p>The Rev. Jesse Halsey, Y.M.C.A. secretary.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d525-f3" n="2" xml:id="d525-f3-content">
                <p>Probably error for Lieut. Hugh S. Martin,
                    Assistant Military Attaché.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
